technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Talking About Future Actions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can use two different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>You use <span class=\"italic\"> will</span> for predictions about actions or situations in the future. It can also be used for situations you cannot control or decisions made at the moment of speaking.</li>  <li>You use <span class=\"italic\"> going to</span> for intentions, plans or ambitions.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject + will + main verb <br> Question word + will + subject + main verb?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Spending time together will be good for the two of you.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to<span class=\\\"strong\\\">\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Subject + am/is/are + going to + main verb <br> Question word + am/is/are + subject + main verb?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> You're going to have so much fun.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "What will you do if you can't find anything there?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We'll take the bus early on Friday. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We'll come back on Monday.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We'll spend the weekend getting ideas for new recipes. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You're going to have so much fun.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Questions With Sentences / Asking for Clarification", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Embedded questions</span> are often used to ask for clarification. An  <span class=\"strong\">embedded question</span> is a question that has a sentence structure within it. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "An <span class=\"strong\">embedded question</span> builds on a simple question.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:  <br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Simple question</span>: Where are you going to stay?<span class=\"strong\"><br/>Embedded question</span>:   Do you know where you're going to stay?</span> <br> <br>You can use <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span> like <span class=\"italic\">Can you tell me ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Do you know if/which/what ... ?</span> to ask for clarification. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart below for some more examples:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Embedded Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you know\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what you're going to do?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you have any idea\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" how busy that neighborhood is?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can you tell me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what time the dinner starts?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Could you tell me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when I have to be there?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you have any idea\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who is in charge of the plans?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Do you have any idea how busy that neighborhood is?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Do you know where you're going to stay?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to look up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to improve", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Things are looking up with Marco.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you make plans for the immediate future.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to improvise", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do something without prior preparation", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We're thinking of staying downtown. We'll improvise.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to play it by ear", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to improvise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What will you do if you can't find anywhere to stay? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We'll play it by ear.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to iron out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to resolve differences; to work things out", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm just excited that Marco and I are ironing out our differences.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "as a matter of fact", "type": "name"}, {"content": "actually; in reality", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Do you have anything exciting planned for the weekend? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: As a matter of fact, I do.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of a friend with a birthday coming up soon.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Plan the birthday party. Think about what you'll need, the people you're going to invite, the presents you are thinking of buying, etc.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write an invitation to the guests. In the invitation, ask one friend to help you prepare the party.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your feelings and reactions about the surprise party with your friend.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about social activities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I react to what I hear and I share my feelings.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about projects in the future.", "type": "text"}]}]}